AD10x (RTX 40xx) support for gpu-unlock: per-arch boot assets, the four-PLM
signature chain and the Ada PCI IDs (Zagitta/gpu-unlock PR #24 at 8a6f6bd,
with 0x2805, plus 0x2684), reduced to kernel/gpu_unlock and rooted there.
By Lance Woodson (woodsonl), with the AD10x four-PLM payload from
TOTORONG/AD103_win_unlocker.

